---
// 「数字の基準」3ページの行き来（ページ下部）。今いるページはグレーにしてリンクにしない
import { getStandardPages, type StandardPage } from "@/lib/standards";

interface Props {
  current: StandardPage["slug"];
}
const { current } = Astro.props;
const pages = getStandardPages();
---

<nav aria-label="数字の基準のページ" class="mt-20 border-t-2 border-ink-950 pt-6">
  <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[2px] text-std-mute">NUMBERS / 数字の基準</p>
  <ol class="mt-5 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6">
    {
      pages.map((p, i) =>
        p.slug === current ? (
          <li>
            <div aria-current="page" class="flex h-full items-center gap-6 bg-std-bg p-6">
              <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <span class="block text-[0.8125rem] text-std-mute">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}　このページ</span>
                <span class="mt-2 block font-bold leading-snug text-std-sub">{p.title}</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </li>
        ) : (
          <li>
            <a
              href={p.path}
              class="group flex h-full items-center gap-6 border border-std-line bg-white p-6 transition-colors hover:border-ink-950"
            >
              <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <span class="block text-[0.8125rem] text-std-mute">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
                <span class="mt-2 block font-bold leading-snug text-ink-950">{p.title}</span>
              </span>
              <span
                class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-std-bg text-xl leading-none text-ink-950 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                ↗
              </span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ),
      )
    }
  </ol>
</nav>
